                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-39318\nSeverity: medium\nPackage: stdlib\nVersion: go1.18.10\nFix Version: 1.20.8,1.21.1\nType: go-module\nLocation: /usr/local/bin/hello-server\nData Namespace: govulndb:language:go\nLink: [CVE-2023-39318](https://go.dev/issue/62196)",
